=== new commit full diff ===
Split the settings max-width rule and drop a dead class

The 720px cap paired a plain selector with a :has() one in a single
comma-separated rule, so a browser without :has() would have dropped the cap
from every settings page, not just node config. .dg-settings-node-page had no
users left.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Entire-Checkpoint: 01M78HB85CS7GFY2P0SJ163HMC


